WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.651
JAMIE: A city council with subpoena
power. That's real.

00:00:03.761 --> 00:00:06.127
ALEX: Can a city council actually do
anything that matters to a frontier

00:00:06.127 --> 00:00:08.494
ALEX: AI lab?

00:00:08.579 --> 00:00:11.885
JAMIE: Maybe not directly. But let me
push back on the framing. The

00:00:11.885 --> 00:00:15.191
JAMIE: question isn't whether New York
City can regulate GPT-5. The question is

00:00:15.191 --> 00:00:18.496
JAMIE: whether New York City can
regulate what city agencies buy, how
they

00:00:18.496 --> 00:00:21.802
JAMIE: audit it, and what vendors have
to disclose to get a municipal

00:00:21.802 --> 00:00:25.108
JAMIE: contract.

00:00:25.173 --> 00:00:27.880
RUFUS: That is a very different kind of
power.
